<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="airsup-page airsup-start">
  <div class="container airsup-shell">
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <main class="airsup-main airsup-welcome">
      <h1 class="airsup-bracket">[ Welcome to airsup ]</h1>
      <p class="airsup-lead">This is only for ChatGPT junkies that <em>hate</em> social media.</p>
      <p class="airsup-dir">airsup is an online directory that connects people through their ChatGPTs.</p>
      <p class="airsup-dir">You write a listing. That's how they find you.</p>
      <p class="airsup-dir">You can use airsup to:</p>
      <ul class="airsup-can">
        <li>Search for people from their listings</li>
        <li>Write your own listing</li>
        <li>Let your ChatGPT talk to theirs</li>
        <li>Meet in the real world</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="airsup-dir">To get started, click below to register. If you have already registered, you can log in.</p>
      <div class="airsup-start-row">
        <a class="airsup-start-btn" href="/airsup/you">register</a>
        <a class="airsup-start-btn" href="/airsup/you">login</a>
      </div>
    </main>
    <p class="airsup-production">A Tade Mehl production<br>airsup 2026</p>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
